{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Free Will returns with a complete edition featuring all 6 episodes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of a quiet small town in search of your missing mother. Along the way, form deep relationships that can last a lifetime. As your investigation unfolds, you\u2019ll uncover secrets buried in the town - some of which are deeply connected to you, your mother, and your family. A mature, emotional narrative filled with twists, mysteries, and questions about the true purpose of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930840/extras/0dc597491e98c27203b03cc1c5e4ec06.avif?t=1757877662\" width=600 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story progresses, you\u2019ll have the chance to romance several women, including 7 main love interests. Relationships are portrayed realistically - you're just an ordinary guy, with no superpowers or magic. Take your time, make the right choices, and build lasting connections that may lead to a meaningful ending with the woman of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930840/extras/56afdaf1ad732d78945c4c6930ed4347.avif?t=1757877662\" width=600 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a visual novel with highly realistic renders and beautifully designed characters. The game features many animated adult scenes. Stunning visuals and smooth animations will fully immerse you in the story and setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930840/extras/edbaa27a9bce1a6e887bc7e875c7ee99.avif?t=1757877662\" width=600 height=444 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic, emotionally grounded story</strong> set in a small American town full of secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple romance paths</strong> with fully developed, realistic female characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meaningful choices that shape your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature themes</strong> including love, grief, and the search for true purpose in life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality visuals and immersive animations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930840/extras/c044096f12afe934d8b3e1abdc317541.avif?t=1757877662\" width=600 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the first <strong>3 episodes for free</strong> right now! Check out Mr Strangelove creator page to find the first 3 episodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note:</strong> Save files from the demo will not be compatible with the Complete Edition. When you purchase the Complete Edition, you\u2019ll need to start from the beginning.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930840?t=1757877662","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930840/f83f050868e96c86bbc064a375d0c5a5efeb0f56/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757877662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930840/c27c532f1188e0ad8cc089f1b9397e4d80af4b44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757877662","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930840/c27c532f1188e0ad8cc089f1b9397e4d80af4b44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757877662","categories":[{"description":"Single-player"